<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="3JN" style="id">3Johan</book>
  <para style="h">3Johan</para>
  <para style="toc1">3Johan</para>
  <para style="toc2">3Johan</para>
  <para style="mt">3Johan</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khrihfa Upa nih, Ka dawt taktakmi Gaius, ca kan kuat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka dawtmi ka hawi, ngandam tein khua na sak i zeizong vialte na caah rem tein a um nakhnga thla kan campiak — thlarau leiah siarem in khua na sa ti kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Biatak leiah zeitluk in dah zumhawktlak in na um ti kha kan unau cheukhat nih an ra ka chimh tikah ka lung aa lawm tuk hringhran — nang cu biatak chungah na um zungzal tawn ko bantuk khan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka fale biatak chungah khua an sa, ti thawng hlei in a ka lawmhter deuhtu zeihmanh a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka dawtmi ka hawi, kan unau hna kha na theihhngalh bal lomi an si nain an ca i nan rak tuahmi kha rian ṭha le zumhawktlak ngaingai a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na rak dawt hnanak kha hika Khrihfabu sinah hin an chim. Hmailei an kalnak ding zongah Pathian duhnak he aa tlak dingin rak bawm ko rih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zeicahtiah Khrih rian ṭuan awk khualtlawn ah khan, a zum lomi sinin bawmhnak zeihmanh la loin, an i thawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cucaah biatak rian kha a ṭuanpitu kan si nakhnga, kannih Khrihfami nih hi hna cu kan bawmh awk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khrihfabu sinah ca tawite hi ka ṭial, sihmanhsehlaw an hruaitu si a duhmi Diotrefes nih khan cun ka chimmi hi zeihmanh ah a rel lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka rat tikah a tuahmi vialte kha ka phuan dih lai; kan konglam i thil ṭhalo tampi a chimmi le lih a chimmi tehna vialte kha. Cun cu lawng cu aa za rih lo, kan unau pawl kha an rat tikah a rak dawnh hna i kan tlung hna seh tiah a titu hna kha i tlunter hna hlah u, tiah a thlauh hna i Khrihfabu chung khan chuah a timh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka dawtmi ka hawi, a ṭha lomi nawl cu i cawn hlah, a ṭhami nawl tu i cawn ko. Thil ṭha a tuahmi paoh cu Pathian mi an si, thil ṭhalo a tuahmi paoh nih cun Pathian kha an hmu lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mi kip nih Demetrius cu an thangṭhat i biatak hrimhrim zong nih a thangṭhat. Cun kannih zong nih kan thangṭhat ve i kan chimmi cu biatak a si ti kha na hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chimh awk tampi kan ngei ko hna, asinain ca le cahang in chimh cu ka duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuan ah ka rak in hmuh hna lai i cu tikah kan pum tu in kan i ruah hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nan cungah daihnak um ko seh. Na hawile vialte nih daihnak an in kuat. Kan hawile vialte kha pumpak cio ah an kut rak kan tlaihpiak hna.
  </para>
</usx>
